{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_spec_document", "label": "Spec Architecture v2.1: BRM Framework", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_camada_1_fonte_oficial", "label": "Camada 1 (Fonte Oficial)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_camada_2_vault", "label": "Camada 2 (Vault)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Op\u00e7\u00e3o A (pgvector como fonte de verdade, Obsidian como vitrine/export write-through) \u00e9 recomendada para a Fase 1 por menor risco: sem conflito de concorr\u00eancia, funciona igual em cloud ou on-prem, n\u00e3o exige o engine no mesmo disco do cliente. Op\u00e7\u00e3o B (Obsidian como fonte real, sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o bidirecional) s\u00f3 se justifica com demanda expl\u00edcita por edi\u00e7\u00e3o bidirecional, pois exige acesso ao filesystem/sync do cliente, resolu\u00e7\u00e3o de conflito de concorr\u00eancia e parsing de wikilinks."}, {"id": "docs_spec_camada_3_agente", "label": "Camada 3 (Agente)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_claude", "label": "Claude", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MCP j\u00e1 garante portabilidade/agnosticismo futuro a outros LLMs de gra\u00e7a pelo protocolo; n\u00e3o vale gastar ciclo de engenharia testando outros modelos (Hermes/Llama) antes de um segundo LLM ser realmente exigido por contrato."}, {"id": "docs_spec_mcp_protocol", "label": "MCP (Model Context Protocol)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_vaultprovider", "label": "VaultProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Implementa\u00e7\u00e3o simples (YAML/pgvector) por dentro, mas atr\u00e1s de um contrato (search, add_note, get_related), para que oferecer Obsidian ou evoluir para o Control Plane na Fase 2 seja troca de adapter, n\u00e3o reescrita de arquitetura."}, {"id": "docs_spec_ruleprovider", "label": "RuleProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_skillprovider", "label": "SkillProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_auditsink", "label": "AuditSink", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_pgvectorvaultprovider", "label": "PgVectorVaultProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_obsidianvaultprovider", "label": "ObsidianVaultProvider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_rule_evaluator", "label": "rule_evaluator.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor"